    "updated_at": "2015-10-30T11:19:20Z",
    "body": "The only other place where it's used \"redundantly\" is for `HTMLHyperlinkElementUtils`, the other cases are on attributes on interfaces to restrict the exposure set.\n\nUntil we change the spec to always specify `Exposed` on interfaces, I think omitting it is better for consistency, and I'll remove it from `HTMLHyperlinkElementUtils` to avoid confusion.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
